# Optional public hosted Brevo signup overrides (not API keys).
# Each form must target its own language list and use double opt-in.
# Both languages have defaults. An empty override disables signup for that language.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_URL_EN=https://your-english-form.sibforms.com/...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_URL_PT_BR=https://your-portuguese-form.sibforms.com/...
